# MuffinCore .gitignore
# Tracks: launcher/management scripts, config templates, release notes/manifests,
# update payload *source* files, docs. Ignores: the game client, per-install runtime
# state (databases, generated configs, logs, backups), secrets, and large binaries.
# Paths are anchored where a generic name (e.g. "Data") would also match source
# folders like "data/sql" on case-insensitive Windows git.

# === Game client (44 GB, proprietary third-party files; never commit) ===
/Conquest Of Azerothcore/Client/

# === Per-install runtime: databases, generated configs, process state, logs, backups ===
**/mysql/
**/.state/
**/Core/Logs/
# Per-update execution logs are machine-specific runtime output.
**/CoA-Repack-Update/*.log
# Generated from Settings/*.template on every start; contain the DB app password.
**/Core/configs/*.conf
**/Core/configs/modules/*.conf
**/BugReport/reports/
**/BugReport/Logs/
**/Update-Backups/
**/Database-Backups/

# === Secrets ===
# MySQL root/app passwords.
**/Settings/database.json
# Contains the upstream bug-report service intake key (see AUDIT_2026-09-13.md, B3).
**/BugReport/relay.py

# === Large or binary release payloads (hashes are recorded in RELEASE.json / MANIFEST.json) ===
/MuffinCore2.1/Data/
/Conquest Of Azerothcore/Server/Data/
**/Runtime/
**/Database/Clean/
**/Source/server-source.zip
*.exe
*.dll
*.pdb
*.rar
*.zip
*.gz
*.dmp

# === OS / editor / tool junk ===
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.tmp
*.bak
*.log
__pycache__/
